---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/13-09/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/13-09/interactions.json';
import {landmarks,tags} from '../../../../lib/equipment/13-09/solver.mjs';
const a='/equipment/13-09/',photo='https://www.leica-microsystems.com/fileadmin/_processed_/a/3/csm_Leica_EM_AFS2_Freeze-substitution-embedding_list_54099be29e.jpg',product='https://www.leica-microsystems.com/products/sample-preparation-for-electron-microscopy/p/leica-em-afs2/downloads/';
const display=x=>Object.entries(x??{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+(Array.isArray(v)?v.join(' / '):String(v))).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="Leica EM AFS2 documentary view" subtitle="" description="Inspect a dormant Leica EM AFS2 model and tag landmarks on a detached inert drawing." wide={true}>
<article id="afs" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/13-09/">← Equipment 13-09</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#afs-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">13-09 / Leica EM AFS2 / Static exterior and inert drawing desk</p><h2>Leica EM AFS2</h2><p>Inspect a documentary exterior, then annotate landmarks on a separate original drawing of an inert 40 × 28 mm plate. Tags stay attached to the same drawing as its revision advances. The instrument is static.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the external model</h3><div id="afs-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Exterior','Desk'].map(k=><button type="button" data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="afs-xr" type="button" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div><canvas id="afs-model" aria-label="Orbitable dormant Leica EM AFS2 exterior and separate inert drawing desk"></canvas><p id="afs-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="e-hint">Orbit, zoom or choose a close-up. The three small desk keys select the notch, center and arrow, from left to right. The green desk key adds the selected drawing tag. Nothing on the instrument operates.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Add a drawing tag</h3>
<form id="afs-form"><div class="e-fields"><label>Landmark<select id="afs-feature">{Object.entries(landmarks).map(([k,v])=><option value={k}>{v.label}</option>)}</select></label><label>Tag<select id="afs-tag">{Object.entries(tags).map(([k,v])=><option value={k}>{v}</option>)}</select></label></div>
<div class="e-row"><button id="afs-add" class="e-run" type="submit">Add drawing tag</button><button id="afs-example" type="button">Load two-note example</button><button id="afs-reset" type="button">Clear tags</button></div></form><p id="afs-status" role="status">Drawing inert-drawing-01 · revision 0.</p>
<svg id="afs-drawing" viewBox="0 0 340 246" role="img" aria-label="Original inert plate drawing with three selectable landmarks"><path d="M50 41H100V59H120V41H290V209H50Z" fill="#397184" stroke="#244e5b" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M155 125h30m-15 -15v30m67 15h24l-7 -6m7 6 -7 6" fill="none" stroke="#e4ece5" stroke-width="2"/>{Object.entries(landmarks).map(([k,v])=><circle data-feature={k} cx={170+6*v.xyMm[0]} cy={125-6*v.xyMm[1]} r="9"><title>{v.label}</title></circle>)}<text x="50" y="229" font-size="13" fill="#294552">Original drawing, 40 × 28 mm</text></svg></section></div>
<section class="e-card"><h3>03 · Inspect revision history</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Revision</th><th>Landmark</th><th>Tag</th><th>X, Y (mm)</th></tr></thead><tbody id="afs-notes"></tbody></table></div><div class="e-row"><button id="afs-json" disabled>Drawing notes JSON</button></div><p>Each tag keeps the immutable source drawing ID, landmark coordinate, and previous and current document revision. Duplicate tags are rejected. This ledger records annotations only. <a href={a+'example-notes.json'}>Example JSON</a>.</p></section>
<section><h3>Documentary model</h3><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'original-front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original dormant AFS2 cylindrical dolly and separate annotation desk"/><figcaption>Original model informed by the <a href={photo}>Leica EM AFS2 product photograph</a>. The detached desk is invented.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={a+'original-work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original AFS2 external cylindrical base, closed platform and optics silhouette"/><figcaption>External platform and microscope silhouette, without access, internal holders or usable controls. The <a href={product}>Leica product listing</a> confirms the model identity.</figcaption></figure></div>
<p>The model’s cylindrical housing is about 0.56 m across; ground-to-column height is about 1.31 m. These are inferred CAD dimensions and not published installation dimensions. The original register’s preparation history and specimen handoff are outside scope. This pass models neither physical state nor any preparation or processing activity.</p></section>
<section id="afs-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(x=><tr><td>{x.id}</td><td>{display(x.expected)}</td><td>{display(x.actual)}</td><td>{x.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification data</a> · <a href={a+'leica-em-afs2.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Named targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles and {m.draws} draw primitives; optional WebXR, physical headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/13-09/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#afs header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#afs h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#afs section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#afs button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#afs button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#afs-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#afs-chart{width:100%;max-height:16rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#afs table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#afs td,#afs th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#afs figure{margin:0}#afs img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
#afs caption{text-align:left}#afs input,#afs select,#afs button{min-width:0}#afs .e-hint{font-size:.92rem}#afs-drawing{width:min(100%,31rem);height:auto;display:block;background:#eeeae1}#afs-drawing [data-feature]{cursor:pointer;fill:#a6c6cf;stroke:#213845;stroke-width:1.3}#afs-drawing .selected{fill:#ebae63;stroke-width:2.7}#afs-drawing .tagged{fill:#7fb87d}#afs-drawing .selected.tagged{stroke:#e28e37;stroke-width:3.3}</style>
